        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas, you're back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "With me...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Am I not welcome here?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Lappland?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not overreact here. What if we disturb the patient's beauty rest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas, quick. Tell our dear judge here I'm just here to deliver some documents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nods)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, Your Honor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "We met a judge at the door who wanted to pass you this. The mayor's ward can't have too many people in here, so Texas and I took it for you right before we walked in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arson of Nuova Volsinii Port, Emergency Court Hearing, Defendant... Eirene?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "The driver lady's your friend, right? Relax, just flip to the back. She was acquitted on the spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas and I happened to sit in that court hearing. So exciting. The Venezias\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, sorry, sorry. I mean the Venezia Trucking and Saluzzo Vino bosses both testified and vouched for her innocence, and even fought over who got to send her home after the trial...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk, tsk. A popular girl to be sure!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way she walked out of the courthouse reminded me of how the famiglie would take a courthouse trip as proof of maturity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
