    },
    {
        "text": "<p=2>November 8th, 1100    11:35 A.M.</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_only_medium",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sign to confirm, receive the verdict, leave the court. The process went smoothly, but Eirene is still a little dizzy. The sunlight stings her eyes, and she lowers her head\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the huge court square are two cars parked on her inevitable path. Both car hoods sport a special emblem\u2014patterns one can see everywhere in Siracusa."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if she didn't recognize the Saluzzo Vino logo or the Venezia family crest, there is no way she could possibly fail to recognize the two men before their respective cars."
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene knows they're waiting for her\u2014Famiglia Saluzzo and Famiglia Venezia."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Congratulations, Signorina Lavazza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...There's nothing worth congratulating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signor Saluzzo, the fire yesterday was an accident, but my worries have indeed been solved, albeit in a confusing way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had been thinking I shouldn't cause you any further trouble, since I ended up asking you to meet with me for nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you showed up today, which means you just declared to everyone\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saluzzos want to help the Truckers' Union, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our present situation does mean some deals are no longer on the table, but I'm sure we both know how valuable a friendship can be in Siracusa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our agreement remains, Signorina Lavazza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "*ahem*\u2014Zio Alberto, I hope I'm not disturbing you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signorina Lavazza helped us transport our tires, and since something has happened to them, I have to work out compensation with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signor Venezia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. Today we've properly met for the first time, but we already have a good understanding between us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said nothing at all in court, which was wonderful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we have a lot to talk about, such as the Truckers' Union and many other matters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get in the car, I'll drive you back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_686_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Venezia Junior\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_carhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_truckengine",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": 1,
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A loud horn interrupts the conversation between the three, and a truck drives between the two cars, coming to a steady stop before Eirene."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_686_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alberto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1544_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Antonio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cardoorc"
    },
    {
        "text": "The driver's door opens, and Eirene sees Lyudmila get off the truck."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$storyendjp_intro",
        "key": "$storyendjp_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go. I came to take you back home. There's a lot back at camp waiting for you to make the call on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cardoorc"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 0,
        "fillfrom": 0.1,
        "fillto": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "direction": 4,
        "fillfrom": 0.1,
        "fillto": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we're home, we have to quickly figure out a way to send Sommer away for a time. He's not safe in the city right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something on your mind, Lyudmila?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila says nothing and hands the lighter she's holding to Eirene."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...? Isn't this Sommer's?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He did everything he could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should have understood long ago the famiglie will never allow anyone who might pose a threat to them to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_driveincar",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "car"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "channel": "car",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 5,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 2,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$sportscarstart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene looks through the rear view mirror and meets the two mob bosses' eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "She suddenly understands why they had confidently testified for her, and why they had both waited for her in the square."
    },
    {
        "text": "Venezia Junior was right. Her silence and their voices means the three parties had reached a tacit understanding in court."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Sommer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, I couldn't find him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene's grip tightens on the lighter."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So things did exceed everyone's expectations, and they had no choice but to come down here and protect me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the price paid...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They want the guys at city hall and the courts to know that the Truckers' Union and the famiglie are on the same boat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those two earlier... they were basically fighting over a territory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The court hearing does not mean the matter has come to a close. It is only just beginning."
    },
    {
        "text": "For a long time to come, the famiglie will become a thorn in the Truckers' Union's side, and she will have to struggle against these people to maintain their tacit, disgraceful understanding."
    },
    {
        "text": "The truck gets farther and farther away from the court square. She looks at the lighter in her hand, and her fear suddenly dissipates somewhat."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not over yet, Alberto, Antonio...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Sommer and I had just moved here from Volsinii, we really thought we left the famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heh. What a joke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Sommer. I'll never trust any of them ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eirene"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "car",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
