    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such an interesting scene, like it came straight out of a film. Saluzzo and Venezia fellas, truck drivers, so many people surrounding that driver lady, they took up half the courthouse square...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "They called it my coming-of-age ceremony, the first time I went into a courthouse. When I came out, there weren't many people greeting me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas had it even worse, haha. She came to Siracusa as a guest, and accidentally got herself involved in a lawsuit. I was the only one who greeted her after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop bringing up your boring pranks, Lappland.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signorina Lappland, thank you for coming here and for the reminder. If there's nothing else, please leave the ward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1564_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're welcome, Just the least I could do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "text": "Carnevale is tomorrow, dear judge. You still have a lot to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorclosequite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was with Lappland the whole time since yesterday noon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the time we reached the port, the fire was already dying. She's not directly involved with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She spent the entire night after that just being a taxi driver. We went to the courthouse today, and then came here to the hospital...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, I'm not sure what she's planning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you still looking through the file, Lavinia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging from its contents, there was no problem whatsoever with the hearing. But the feeling I'm getting is all too familiar for my liking...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They covered everything in the trial, and the testimony and evidence are stated in detail, but other than getting someone acquitted, it didn't find out any truths or solve any problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "In Volsinii, and other places in Siracusa, most cases can only end up with a case file like this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had thought such a trial would no longer exist here in Nuova Volsinii.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lavinia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to console me, Texas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What concerns me more, is when did these people actually start to care about whether a civilian outside the famiglie is innocent or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's more, before this hearing, Famiglia Venezia had a near perfect record in the city you couldn't easily find a reason for criticism, but this time Venezia Junior actually showed up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "From Demetri to Ingrid\u2014I may spent the last two days chasing in the wrong direction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is certain, before this trial\u2014or because of this trial, they are now on the same side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leon's car accident, the hit-and-run vehicle, and the port fire. These three obviously have a deeper connection...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saluzzos, the Venezias, and the Truckers' Union. What are these three forces hiding from us together?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lavinia closes the file, running her hand over the court emblem, then the 'New Urban Management Act' on the cover."
    },
    {
        "text": "After a moment, she raises her head."
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas looks at her friend. She seemed somewhat gloomy and confused earlier, but she is definitely back to her old self now."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Carnevale is tomorrow, but Leon is still in a coma... I'm running out of time to figure out what kind of plans they have in store.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't let the situation worsen, let alone stay sitting fowls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These people still think the New Urban Management Act is something they can use, but I shall show them it is the foundation of order in this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
